atlas/arkansas/hempstead-county"],["ARC or PLC in Hempstead County","/arc-plc/arkansas/hempstead-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids runs 75 years, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025, April to May came in at 182% of normal on the middle of the grids, while November to December fell to 67%. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 50% and February to March at 49% on the middle of the grids. Every grid in the county had its driest year in 2005, with grid 16045 at 58%.</p>"}
